          },
          "outcome": {
            "description": "Whether the tool ran and answered or failed to run, as a machine-readable category: `clean`\nor `findings` for a `check` that ran, `execution_failure` for one that could not reach the\nengine. Set only where the exit status alone cannot separate an answer from a failure, which\ntoday is `check_kotlin_syntax`: its exit 1 means both \"found a syntax error\" and \"the engine\nis missing\", and an agent branching on `isError` has to be able to tell them apart.",
            "type": [
